  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In densely green Green Lotus Great World stands a black and white mountain. At its peak, rows of chairs extend downward. The top two seats are empty; Qin Ding Ling sits fourth and must obey the three fairies above her. Fairy Ming Hao holds the third seat and controls the situation while the first and second fairies are away.",
      "chapters": [
        2155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_green_lotus_great_world",
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "char_fairy_ming_hao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An information path Gu worm from Fairy Ming Hao lands mid-mountain before Mu Cha Lang and Qing Hao Zi. From there those Gu Immortals leave with troops for the Yellow Earth front.",
      "chapters": [
        2155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "middle-mountain-gu-immortals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "char_mu_cha_lang",
        "char_qing_hao_zi",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Hao Zi attributes the kill order against Yellow Earth Gu Immortals to the Sacred Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        2156
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "orders-to-kill",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Green Lotus Gu Immortals ask how they would face the sages on the Sacred Mountain if they retreated without fighting Fang Yuan’s reinforcements.",
      "chapters": [
        2157
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sages-on-the-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch and Xiao He Jian charge to the center of Green Lotus Great World, below the Sacred Mountain. The whole mountain is black and white; rocks look drawn with black lines and filled with white paper patches. Life forms on it become white paper people drawn with black lines. A tiny white paper person flies down and, after leaving the mountain’s area, returns to flesh and blood as Fairy Ming Hao. When attackers try to bypass her for the mountain, she resonates with it and the black-line white-paper mountain shoots profound lights carrying countless killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "black-lines-and-white-paper",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ice_crystal_immortal_monarch",
        "char_xiao_he_jian"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s subordinates conclude the mountain is not an ordinary famous mountain but a secluded domain of heaven and earth, and ask whether it is the legendary Book Mountain from the Legends of Ren Zu. Fairy Ming Hao says her killer move humble reciprocation uses humility Gu as core and uses information recorded on Book Mountain to deduce and unleash the killer moves they use.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "book-mountain-identity",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_book_mountain",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
        "gu_humility_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After gaining the advantage, Fairy Ming Hao orders the rank eight Gu Immortals of the Sacred Mountain to chase and kill Fang Yuan’s subordinates.",
      "chapters": [
        2160
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-eight-pursuit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
